## Vendored engine

`vendor/pocketjs` is not in this repository. `scripts/vendor.ts` clones
https://github.com/pocket-stack/pocketjs at the commit pinned in
`UPSTREAM.commit` and applies the patches in `patches/` in sorted order.

  PocketJS — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Yifeng "Evan" Wang.

The patches under `patches/` are part of this repository and are MIT. Each is
a diff against that upstream commit and carries no third-party code of its own.


